<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 197 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 197 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand scored 197 all out in their 50 overs in the Champions' Trophy one-day match against Pakistan on Sunday.</p>
